BEGIN_PGML Let [`f(x)=[$func]`] and let [`T_2(x)=b_0+b_1x+b_2x^2\text{.}`] We find the values of [`b_0, b_1`] and [`b_2`] that make the functions [`f(x)`] and [`T_2(x)`] have the same height, slope, and concavity at [`x=0\text{.}`]
END_PGML
